{
  "$comment": "Upstream sources for the in-repo font pipeline (scripts/fonts/). Build-time only: the generated slices under src/fonts/station-sans/ are committed, so a normal build never touches the network.",
  "upstream": {
    "font": "Noto Sans CJK (Source Han Sans)",
    "repo": "https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk",
    "path": "Sans/OTF",
    "mirrors": [
      "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/notofonts/noto-cjk@main",
      "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/notofonts/noto-cjk/main"
    ],
    "license": {
      "id": "OFL-1.1",
      "file": "src/fonts/station-sans/OFL.txt",
      "source": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/google/fonts@main/ofl/notosanssc/OFL.txt",
      "reservedFontName": "Source",
      "rename": "Station Sans SC/TC/JP are subsetted derivatives of Noto Sans CJK. The OFL reserved font name 'Source' (and the Noto name) is therefore not used: the families are renamed, and this file plus OFL.txt ship with every slice."
    }
  },
  "subset": {
    "sliceSize": 140,
    "keepFeatures": ["ccmp", "calt", "clig", "liga", "kern", "mark", "mkmk"],
    "dropTables": ["DSIG", "gasp", "meta", "vhea", "vmtx"],
    "$why": [
      "locl is dropped on purpose. Regional glyph forms come from the family instead: each family is built from that language's own upstream OTF, whose default cmap mapping is already the language's baked forms. Carrying all four regional variant sets in one family costs ~1.9x per codepoint (measured: 472 vs 244 B/codepoint) and would make the rendering depend on the browser's lang -> locl mapping, which cannot be verified in this workspace.",
      "vert/vrt2 and the vertical metrics tables are dropped: the site has no vertical CJK.",
      "ruby, trad, smpl, aalt, dlig, hist, fwid, hwid, pwid and halt/palt are unused by the site's CSS and would only add closure glyphs."
    ]
  },
  "families": [
    {
      "id": "sc",
      "family": "Station Sans SC",
      "subdir": "SimplifiedChinese",
      "coverageFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
      "weights": [
        {
          "name": "Regular",
          "css": 400,
          "file": "NotoSansCJKsc-Regular.otf",
          "bytes": 16437364,
          "sha256": "2c76254f6fc379fddfce0a7e84fb5385bb135d3e399294f6eeb6680d0365b74b"
        },
        {
          "name": "Medium",
